Z||000009||turbo86se||08-15-2000||12:42 AM||||GT Bastard, the wheels are 16" Team Loco's, with the Anthracite center. I love the way they look! I think the model number is 182. <BR>I've got 205/55/16 on the front, and 225/50/16 on the rear.<P>Robertvol, LMK when you do come up here, we'll definitely have to trade!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Oh BTW, the red Ferrari Dino (86GT) is for sale, I think the owner is asking $16,000 for it. Low miles, performance rebuilt engine, 5-spd, mint tan interior, new red paint. Runs great, turns heads everywhere. That's my mechanic working on a PISA Scorpion (88 Formula), he installed a 3800 in it, and is working on the cruise control.   Email me if you're interested in the Dino.||||reg||1
